### Feature Consultation — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (is_active = false)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name deleteConsultationPhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/consultas/{{id}}

###

# @name deleteConsultationLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/consultas/{{id}}/deactivate
